    "details": "<h2>HORIZON XT &rsquo;26 &ndash; Driving Innovation. Creating Impact. Transforming Lives.</h2>\n<p>Get ready for <strong>HORIZON XT &rsquo;26</strong>, a 36-hour hackathon focused on research, innovation, and real-world problem-solving! Bring your ideas to life, collaborate with passionate innovators, and develop impactful solutions that make a difference.</p>\n<p><strong>Event Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>36-Hour Hackathon | October 26&ndash;28, 2026</li>\n<li>₹1,00,000 Prize Pool</li>\n<li>Cash Prizes, Trophies &amp; HorizonXT Awards</li>\n<li>Certificates of Recognition</li>\n<li>Free Food &amp; Beverages</li>\n<li>Exclusive Hacker Swag Kits</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Team Requirements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Teams must consist of <strong>2&ndash;4 members</strong>.</li>\n<li>College credentials are required for every team member.</li>\n<li>LinkedIn profile links must be provided for all team members.</li>\n<li>Participation in the hackathon is subject to <strong>shortlisting based on abstract submission</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Participant Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Every verified participant receives certificates, free food and beverages, and exclusive hacker swag kits during the event.</li>\n<li>100% Free Participation</li>\n<li>Participate, innovate, and compete <strong>without any registration fee!</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Ready to Make an Impact?</h2>\n<p>Assemble your squad, submit your abstract, and showcase your technical excellence at HORIZON XT &rsquo;26.</p>\n<p><strong>HORIZON XT &rsquo;26 &mdash; Driving Innovation. Creating Impact. Transforming Lives.</strong></p>",
